{"id":"a164592c16c3d7fb","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-model2-ultraproduct-model.md","title":"ZFC Model2 Ultraproduct Model","display":"df-zfc-model2-ultraproduct-model — ZFC Model2 Ultraproduct Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model2-ultraproduct-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model2-ultraproduct-model"],"display":"df-zfc-model2-ultraproduct-model — ZFC Model2 Ultraproduct Model","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-logic-ultraproduct-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model2-ultraproduct-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model2-ultraproduct-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model2-ultraproduct-model — ZFC Model2 Ultraproduct Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"884f409edcb44ced\" href=\"?note=884f409edcb44ced\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-logic-ultraproduct-structure.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-logic-ultraproduct-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U,F,I,U\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal U,F,I,U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> are the imported typed function and structure predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicUltraproductStructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicUltraproductStructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> is the imported pointwise-modulo-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> ultraproduct construction</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2UltraproductModel}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel2UltraproductModel}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}ultraproduct\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel2UltraproductModel}_S(\\mathcal U,F,I,U)\\leftrightarrow\nI\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\n\\land\\exists R,L\\in V\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,R)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(F(i),L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLogicUltraproductStructure}_S(\\mathcal U,F,U)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}ultraproduct\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel2UltraproductModel}_S(\\mathcal U,F,I,U)\\leftrightarrow\nI\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\n\\land\\exists R,L\\in V\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,R)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(F(i),L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLogicUltraproductStructure}_S(\\mathcal U,F,U)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The family has an explicit set codomain witness <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> instead of the circular type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(F)\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(F)\\)</span>; the common language and indexed-family domain remain explicit.</li>\n<li>The quotient structure is delegated to its existing typed construction.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-logic-ultraproduct-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"884f409edcb44ced","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-logic-ultraproduct-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U,F,I,U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicUltraproductStructure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2UltraproductModel}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}ultraproduct\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel2UltraproductModel}_S(\\mathcal U,F,I,U)\\leftrightarrow\nI\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\n\\land\\exists R,L\\in V\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,R)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(F(i),L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLogicUltraproductStructure}_S(\\mathcal U,F,U)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(F)","display":false}],"bytes":1602,"backlinks":[{"id":"c974598a1c0699ec","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel2UltraproductModel}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[58-df-zfc-model2-ultraproduct-model]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2750","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-model2-ultraproduct-model.md|58-df-zfc-model2-ultraproduct-model]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","36d7463d215be751","d9b8711cda3f31ca","884f409edcb44ced"]}